    <briefdescription>
<para>Store a persistent ordering for a subset based on the list. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><simplesect kind="return"><para>a list of indexes into s, representing a permutation of the particles in s, so that they are ordered according to all_particles. This order can be used to write s to disk, as the order in s can change between domino runs. </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
